ClickGotchi

ClickGotchi is a RockBox plugin for the iPod Video 5.5G. It is a port of the CYDgotchi
pet, which lives in the LoRagotchi-DX project.

Parts taken from LoRagotchi-DX (MIT License, Copyright (c) 2025 Scott Powell / rippleradios.com;
Copyright (c) 2026 Robert Rayner / M0YNW, LoRaGotchi DX modifications):
  - sprite masks, colours, scenery, egg/hatch/memorial art
  - care rules (happiness, waste, cleaning, life stages)
  - the tropical fish mask, generated from examples/cyd_pet/CydSplashArt.h
    (tools/fish/generate_tropical_mask.py)

The plugin itself is GPL-2.0-or-later, like the RockBox plugins it is built with. See LICENSE.
RockBox is a separate project: https://www.rockbox.org (source: https://github.com/Rockbox/rockbox).
